@startuml
title Diagram 4 — Siklus Hidup Lead → Peluang

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

state "Lead Baru" as LB
state "Lead — Kualifikasi" as LK
state "Lead — Hilang" as LH
state "Kontak + Akun + Peluang\n(hasil konversi)" as CONV

[*] --> LB : lead ditangkap\n(manual / webhook inbound)
LB --> LK : penugasan ke sales\n+ mulai kualifikasi
LK --> LH : tidak lolos kualifikasi
LK --> CONV : konversi

state "Pipeline Peluang" as PIPE {
  state "Stage 1" as S1
  state "Stage 2" as S2
  state "Stage ..." as SN
  state "Closed-Won" as CW
  state "Closed-Lost" as CL

  [*] --> S1
  S1 --> S2
  S2 --> SN
  SN --> CW : penutupan
  SN --> CL : penutupan
}

CONV --> S1
CW --> [*]
CL --> [*]

note right of PIPE
  Jumlah dan nama stage BELUM ditetapkan
  di knowledge base — perlu finalisasi hari 1.
  Diagram ini menunjukkan pola, bukan daftar stage final.

  Nilai deal pada Closed-Won menjadi
  sumber revenue & quota attainment (DEC-016).
end note

note bottom of LH
  Alasan hilang dicatat untuk analisis,
  bukan untuk penilaian individu.
end note
@enduml
